From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] inseng: install engine state, CIF components, download/install (3650)

inseng: install engine state, CIF components, download/install, installed check

IInstallEngine now keeps its state (CIF, base URL, download dir, install drive,
options, HWND, stream, callback), reads the component information file, enumerates
install/download IDs, reports sizes, checks the installed version in the registry,
downloads and installs components with callback notifications, supports
Abort/Suspend/Resume and LaunchExtraCommand (INF section).

Rebased at integration (integ-2026-10) onto 3035/3038 (fast-a): 3650's install engine (a superset of 3035's settings and callback state) replaces 3035's version of those methods; 3038's CheckTrustEx (HRESULT, TRUST_E_PROVIDER_UNKNOWN: no signature check, never trusted) kept.
